 "section_summary": "This section contains part of a comprehensive statistical study and directory of educational institutions in Tokushima Prefecture, Japan, prepared by the Civil Information and Education (CIE) Section of GHQ/SCAP in cooperation with the Japanese Ministry of Education. It includes the report's Table of Contents, an introductory overview of the Japanese educational administration and school classification system prior to the post-war 6-3-3-4 reform, twelve summary statistical tables showing student enrollment and teacher counts as of April 30 and November 30, 1946 across various control jurisdictions, and the initial 47 pages of the institutional roster detailing individual higher, secondary, and elementary schools.",
